  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01d1536b16b4e1f579c9cf16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐。\r\n我由衷祈愿你的每一天，\r\n都充满幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6ab8247210ab8e55e9688c70d0d411b54cee53a066ddefa33e4d711628edd1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b3df543e7de2db6d332ce94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就如我先前曾向你提及的一样，今天\r\n会在我的老家举办一年一度的餐会。\r\n还请你别忘记出席。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b217c4cdb0b0c4a6527b4fc681e10a59c8f89ead9468cd4c086d0d9676f9e502",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c21986be2e7868a71ece4f46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我认为自己不需要\r\n非社交目的的庆生会。\r\n……但还是感谢你的体贴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f17bf1e04772c01a0335ac43c7a74e5e122605fc9baad43c750b23cc67a12017",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:317e336c71c08f8fa1c3263d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新公告。\r\n请仔细确认，别遗漏了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c40aef526f99becff0bc086f06a862d0c205109e0a6f724e9ee1599c0703503",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:028498d1f6340d8d326330ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "礼物送到了。\r\n请你尽早确认。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d375e5337933fe682c63f0c5a51e9208641fdc987f0de4eb7c5975ff70b8372",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2f7935b3275f874c756c54a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成了啊。\r\n达成该达成的职责，\r\n这是最为重要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f92490d84564a610dd612a84fa9122c09a19baf24e3c511a57814b3e1f52f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:136ae44746d6139b24c92c85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动很快就要开始了。\r\n搜集情报是你的职责，别松懈了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "746636e3c342bdaebabb46c0f93b0f1563a3dee6cc54b7f0a3a599eab64d186e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e56e9779656f7bfde019ec84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动似乎正在举办当中。\r\n由于时间一去不复返，\r\n可别让自己留下后悔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d712c9f7af36cecd7a970e5c4b8d6fd8006c24d27ae158172c0d0f0f20968a8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:646c7857fa3df44bf90de6f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定会赢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc13d8ca1b9968c42a22be06eb01c11f3c7b8c87e76726f7820e0b5ea57e65a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:270b87f9ea2b87abd69f10b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册的等级提升了。\r\n请你确认。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f52ff1c822b462eb1ec07c6532d2f8a870f7c41e9883c46d01b110c1920458a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3807a8aee5a13e1bf5539619",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我们家族一直关照的裁缝店的精品。\n据说是为了展现我的形象而设计的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cecc1ead44b7737dadc6c6885c019d04f89100f6bce3c298f9249dabb2e8c71d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:339edcd02d070f8524d40950",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戴上从母亲那里得到的饰品后，父亲\n大人十分惊讶。  因为实在太像了，\n简直一模一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4552fb731c3ec1f600ddebbd717970a2f773c84a2b5144970eff4aa02f5bb322",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1be7762daf314def1bee79ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "假日的度过方式，吗？\n有很多种呢…主要是出席社交场合或者\n为了陶冶情操而进行的艺术鉴赏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "953c5aa55fee11c1b62a236f5660196d6f4bdf91767d537a71111961f046e48e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f04c997d7df48157a896f2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要更加努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "326d0edb11e9270e502b18c97ebb6c26297ce0fc11c619418bba9646d1d9f02b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:678d661b105b16a46bbc716f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我们的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df40836527fa18e0f0dd5666950e1463686e6432d814f80a0d2367da2797d2ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc93c547093f24afaf2c2b5c",
